    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an SEO content strategist for Lyra FinX, an AI-focused personal finance brand for a South Asian audience (Pakistan first).\n\nUsing only the signals below, propose 10 blog topic candidates.\n\nCore themes and seed keywords:\n{{ $json.seeds }}\n\nGoogle Autocomplete suggestions (what people type):\n{{ $json.autocomplete }}\n\nTrending Reddit questions this week:\n{{ $json.reddit }}\n\nPosts we already published (do NOT repeat or closely duplicate these):\n{{ $json.existing }}\n\nScoring rules:\n- fit_score (1-10): how well the topic fits Lyra FinX (AI tools for money, practical personal finance, Pakistan or South Asia relevance).\n- opportunity_score (1-10): how attractive the topic looks given the signals, a low-competition angle, and clear search intent.\n- difficulty_guess: low, medium or high. This is a rough judgement, NOT measured data.\n- source_signal: autocomplete, reddit or both.\n- Never invent search volumes or statistics.\n- Avoid topics that need personalised financial advice (specific stock picks, guaranteed returns). Prefer educational angles.\n- Each title must be specific and click-worthy, under 70 characters where possible.\n\nOutput format: respond with raw JSON only. Do NOT wrap it in markdown code fences, do not add backticks, and do not write any text before or after the JSON.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "batching": {}
      },
      "id": "8e0b76a2-73fc-4d6c-a0ac-dc2283f9e966",
